# Excalidraw app (`excalidraw-app`)

## Scope

This workspace is the **product shell** around `@excalidraw/excalidraw`. Prefer implementing editor behavior in `packages/excalidraw` or lower packages; keep here only hosting-specific logic (collab, storage, PWA, routing).

## Imports

- Use **`@excalidraw/excalidraw`** (and other `@excalidraw/*` packages) for editor APIs — avoid deep imports into `packages/excalidraw/...` paths from the app.
- Shared types/constants: `@excalidraw/common`, `@excalidraw/element` when the app truly needs them; do not duplicate editor internals.

## Collab, data, Firebase

- **`data/firebase.ts`**, **`collab/`**: treat as security-sensitive (keys, room IDs, uploads). Follow `.cursor/rules/security.md`.
- Scene updates should go through the **public imperative API** (`excalidrawAPI.updateScene`, etc.) unless an existing internal hook is already used in this folder.

## Styles

- SCSS may import variables from the library (e.g. `packages/excalidraw/css/...`) — keep paths stable and avoid copying large bundles of editor styles into the app.

## How to verify

- From repo root: `yarn start` (runs `excalidraw-app`) and manually test flows you changed (collab, import/export, sidebar).
- `yarn test:code` and targeted tests under `excalidraw-app/` if tests exist for the area.
